          <Pad Id="StYtSDxoah9SyZbXmWVoe0" Bounds="660,922,660,96" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Geometry: VL.NetTopologySuite makes it (Point, Polygon, Read WKT) and defines Feature; this package only draws and picks them.&#xD;&#xA;Files and services: VL.GeoJSON reads the format data arrives in.&#xD;&#xA;Manners: tiles come from donated servers. Nothing fetches until Enabled is on, only drawn tiles are kept, and requests name this package.&#xD;&#xA;If Layers Built ever climbs frame after frame, close vvvv.">
